        "description": "High-resolution CT showing diffuse interstitial thickening without honeycombing",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "exclusion-other-ild",
        "description": "Exclusion of other interstitial lung diseases by clinical, radiologic, and histologic evaluation",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of characteristic histopathology on lung biopsy plus compatible clinical presentation and exclusion of other interstitial lung diseases",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires lung biopsy; non-invasive tests are supportive but not definitive."
